    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fractured Fables</strong> is an open-world action RPG set in the vibrant fantasy realm of Aethel, where you take on the role of a prophesied Elementum\u2014an awakened hero destined to command the ancient forces of water, air, earth, and fire. Explore a richly detailed medieval world filled with hidden secrets, dynamic environments, and powerful foes. Master a strategic elemental combat system where your chosen element shapes your abilities, weapons, and interactions with the environment. Customize your character\u2019s race, elemental alignment, and combat style to create a unique playthrough experience, supported by branching narratives and diverse skill trees. From summoning elemental creatures to crafting powerful gear through Arcanium Crafting, every choice you make influences your journey and the fate of Aethel.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fractured Fables</strong> is an open-world action RPG set in the vibrant fantasy realm of Aethel, where you take on the role of a prophesied Elementum\u2014an awakened hero destined to command the ancient forces of water, air, earth, and fire. Explore a richly detailed medieval world filled with hidden secrets, dynamic environments, and powerful foes. Master a strategic elemental combat system where your chosen element shapes your abilities, weapons, and interactions with the environment. Customize your character\u2019s race, elemental alignment, and combat style to create a unique playthrough experience, supported by branching narratives and diverse skill trees. From summoning elemental creatures to crafting powerful gear through Arcanium Crafting, every choice you make influences your journey and the fate of Aethel.</p>",
    "short_description": "Fractured Fables is an open-world action RPG with a deep elemental system\u2014water, air, earth, and fire\u2014each offering unique abilities. Specialize or combine elements, customize your hero, and conquer epic quests against powerful creatures in a richly crafted fantasy world.",
